---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Support">
  <header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Support the work</span><h1>Help the useful experiments stay maintained.</h1><p>Stars, issues, thoughtful notes, and sponsorship all help local-first tools and agent workflows remain documented and usable.</p></header>
  <div class="support-options">
    <section><span>China</span><h2>Direct support</h2><div class="qr-pair"><figure><img src="/assets/img/support/alipay-qr.png" alt="Alipay QR code" /><figcaption>Alipay</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/assets/img/support/wechat-qr.png" alt="WeChat Pay QR code" /><figcaption>WeChat Pay</figcaption></figure></div></section>
    <section><span>Everywhere</span><h2>Non-financial support</h2><ul><li>Star a project you actually use.</li><li>Open an issue with a concrete failure.</li><li>Share a tool with the person who needs it.</li><li>Tell me what should stay quiet.</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/KKenny0" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit GitHub ↗</a></section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
